      "q": "What should I bring to the first conversation?",
      "a": "Begin with your ownership structure, goals and the decision you need help making. Prepare financial statements, household spending, account summaries, debt and guarantee documents, employee-plan information and relevant agreements. Ask which records are necessary and confirm a secure sharing method before providing sensitive documents."
